389 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (Build a production-grade LLM gateway that can:\nRoute requests across multiple model providers through one unified, OpenAI-compatible API.\nJudge prompt difficulty and route automatically - cheap models for simple prompts, strong models for hard ones proven against a labeled eval set.\nFall back automatically when a provider goes down, rate-limits, or degrades.\nStream responses token by token, end to end, without buffering.\nMeter usage per tenant -  every request, every token, every dollar.\nEnforce cost budgets and rate limits per team.\nAnswer repeated questions from a semantic cache instead of paying for the same tokens twice.\nKeep a request log complete enough to debug any AI traffic issue.)
/K [7]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 390 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
endobj
