/ActualText (Semantic Response Cache\nServe cached responses for semantically similar prompts \(not just exact matches\), scoped per key.\nReport hits via the header contract and track hit rates.\nMetering, Request Logs & Usage API\nCompute cost per request from the price table using provider-reported token usage.\nLog every request \(key, model, provider, status, tokens, cost, cache result, fallback flag, latency\) and expose a usage summary API.\nSimple Ops Console & Verification\nA simple frontend: usage by key, recent requests, cache hit rate \(vibe-coding fine\).\nMust pass scripts/smoke_test.py; run scripts/load_test.py and the routing eval, and report results.)
